<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>柳井 市民参加型共創プラットフォーム — BLOOM</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Zen+Kaku+Gothic+New:wght@400;500;700;900&family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&family=Outfit:wght@400;600;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles/bloom.css">
  <style>
    /* ══ HEADER ══════════════════════════════════════════ */
    header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(245, 251, 255, 0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--border);
      padding: 0 1.5rem;
    }

    .hdr-inner {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      height: 64px;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .logo-blob {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--teal), var(--plum));
      border-radius: 14px 6px 14px 6px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: white;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .logo-name {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .logo-ja {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .logo-sub {
      font-size: 10px;
      color: var(--teal);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    nav a {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: var(--teal);
    }

    .btn-login {
      background: var(--teal);
      color: white;
      padding: 9px 20px;
      border-radius: 100px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(27, 158, 139, 0.25);
    }

    .btn-login:hover {
      background: var(--teal2);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    /* ══ VIEW TABS ═══════════════════════════════════════ */
    .top-tabs {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
      background: var(--card);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      position: sticky;
      top: 64px;
      z-index: 99;
    }

    .ttab {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border-radius: 100px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      border: 2px solid transparent;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.25s;
      background: none;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .ttab .ttab-icon {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 14px;
      background: var(--border);
      transition: background 0.25s;
    }

    .ttab.active {
      background: var(--teal);
      color: white;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(27, 158, 139, 0.25);
    }

    .ttab.active .ttab-icon {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    }

    .ttab:hover:not(.active) {
      color: var(--teal);
      border-color: var(--teal);
    }

    /* ══ VIEW PANELS ═════════════════════════════════════ */
    .vpanel {
      display: none;
    }

    .vpanel.active {
      display: block;
    }

    /* ══ HERO ════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    .hero {
      padding: 4rem 1.5rem 3rem;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .infog {
      position: relative;
      width: 380px;
      height: 380px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .infog-center {
      position: absolute;
      width: 150px;
      height: 150px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--teal), var(--plum));
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 16px rgba(27, 158, 139, 0.08), 0 0 0 32px rgba(27, 158, 139, 0.04);
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .infog-center-lbl {
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }

    .infog-center-num {
      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
      font-size: 2.4rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: white;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .sat {
      position: absolute;
      width: 96px;
      height: 96px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 4px;
      border: 2px solid var(--border);
      background: white;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.25s;
      text-align: center;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .sat:hover {
      transform: scale(1.08);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14);
    }

    .sat-icon {
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .sat-lbl {
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .sat-n {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--teal);
    }

    .sat-ws { top: 0; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); }
    .sat-online { top: 50%; right: 0; transform: translateY(-50%); }
    .sat-data { bottom: 0; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); }
    .sat-arch { top: 50%; left: 0; transform: translateY(-50%); }

    .orbit-ring {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 30px;
      border: 1.5px dashed rgba(27, 158, 139, 0.2);
      border-radius: 50%;
      animation: rotateRing 20s linear infinite;
    }

    @keyframes rotateRing {
      to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
    }

    /* ══ HERO TEXT ═══════════════════════════════════════ */
    .hero-text {}

    .hero-eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: rgba(27, 158, 139, 0.1);
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(27, 158, 139, 0.25);
      color: var(--teal);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 100px;
      margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
    }

    .pulse {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      background: var(--teal);
      border-radius: 50%;
      animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(27, 158, 139, 0.5); }
      60% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(27, 158, 139, 0); }
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.2rem);
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .hero-title .em {
      color: var(--teal);
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.85;
      max-width: 440px;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .dual-cta {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.8rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .cta-ws, .cta-online {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      color: white;
      padding: 13px 22px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(27, 158, 139, 0.3);
      transition: all 0.3s;
    }

    .cta-ws {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--teal), var(--teal2));
    }

    .cta-ws:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(27, 158, 139, 0.4);
    }

    .cta-online {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--plum), #5038CC);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(107, 78, 255, 0.25);
    }

    .cta-online:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(107, 78, 255, 0.35);
    }

    .cta-icon {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .cta-text {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .cta-sub {
      font-size: 10px;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }

    /* ══ SECTION COMMON ══════════════════════════════════ */
    .section {
      padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .section-hdr {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.5vw, 2.2rem);
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .link-all {
      color: var(--teal);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    .link-all:hover {
      color: var(--teal2);
    }

    /* ══ SPACES GRID ═════════════════════════════════════ */
    .spaces-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .space-card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 20px;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: all 0.25s;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .space-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--teal);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(27, 158, 139, 0.12);
    }

    .sc-thumb {
      height: 110px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      position: relative;
    }

    .sc-badge {
      position: absolute;
      top: 10px;
      left: 10px;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 100px;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    }

    .b-open {
      background: #D0F0EB;
      color: #0D7A6A;
    }

    .b-soon {
      background: #FFF0C2;
      color: #9A6B00;
    }

    .b-done {
      background: #EEEEF6;
      color: #666;
    }

    .sc-body {
      padding: 1.1rem;
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .sc-cat {
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      color: var(--teal);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    }

    .sc-title {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1.45;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      flex: 1;
    }

    .sc-footer {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-top: 0.8rem;
      margin-top: 0.6rem;
    }

    .sc-meta {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--sm);
    }

    .sc-voices {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--teal);
    }

    .chips {
      display: flex;
      gap: 6px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .chip {
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 100px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--muted);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      background: none;
    }

    .chip.active {
      background: var(--teal);
      border-color: var(--teal);
      color: white;
    }

    .chip:hover:not(.active) {
      border-color: var(--teal);
      color: var(--teal);
    }

    /* ══ DASHBOARD ═══════════════════════════════════════ */
    .dash-bg {
      background: var(--ink);
      padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .dash-inner {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .dash-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.8fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .dc {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 1.4rem;
    }

    .dc-lbl {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    }

    .dc .dash-title {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      color: white;
      margin: 0.3rem 0 0.1rem;
    }

    .trend-up {
      color: #3BB573;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .mini-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 9px;
    }

    .mb-lbl {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
      width: 64px;
      text-align: right;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .mb-track {
      flex: 1;
      height: 8px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
      border-radius: 4px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .mb-fill {
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .mb-val {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: white;
      width: 24px;
    }

    .sent4 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .s4item {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 0.7rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .s4pct {
      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .s4lbl {
      font-size: 10px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
      margin-top: 3px;
    }

    .sparkline {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      gap: 4px;
      height: 48px;
      margin-top: 0.8rem;
    }

    .sp-bar {
      flex: 1;
      border-radius: 3px 3px 0 0;
      background: rgba(27, 158, 139, 0.35);
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }

    .sp-bar:hover {
      background: var(--teal);
    }

    /* ══ FOOTER ══════════════════════════════════════════ */
    footer {
      background: var(--ink);
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem 1.5rem;
      border-top: 2px solid var(--border);
    }

    .fi {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .ftop {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .fb-brand p {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-top: 0.8rem;
      max-width: 240px;
    }

    .fc h4 {
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: white;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    }

    .fc ul {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 7px;
    }

    .fc ul li a {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
      font-size: 12px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .fc ul li a:hover {
      color: var(--teal);
    }

    .fbot {
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    /* ══ RESPONSIVE ══════════════════════════════════════ */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hero {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .infog {
        width: 280px;
        height: 280px;
      }

      .dash-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .ftop {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      nav {
        display: none;
      }

      .spaces-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ANNOUNCE -->
<div style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--teal), var(--plum)); padding: 9px 1.5rem; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: white; letter-spacing: 0.04em;">
  ✨ 第3回ワークショップ参加者募集中！3月15日（土）14:00〜 <a href="#" style="color: var(--sun); text-decoration: underline;">詳細・申込みはこちら →</a>
</div>

<!-- HEADER -->
<header>
  <div class="hdr-inner">
    <a href="#" class="logo">
      <div class="logo-blob">YC</div>
      <div class="logo-name">
        <span class="logo-ja">市民参加型共創プラットフォーム</span>
        <span class="logo-sub">柳井デジタル・コモンズ</span>
      </div>
    </a>
    <nav>
      <a href="#spaces">とりくみ</a>
      <a href="#dashboard">データ</a>
      <a href="#participate">参加する</a>
      <a href="/admin.html" class="btn-login">ログイン</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- TOP TABS -->
<div class="top-tabs">
  <button class="ttab active" onclick="showPanel('home', this)">
    <span class="ttab-icon">🏠</span>ホーム
  </button>
  <button class="ttab" onclick="showPanel('ws', this)">
    <span class="ttab-icon">🏘</span>ワークショップ
  </button>
  <button class="ttab" onclick="showPanel('online', this)">
    <span class="ttab-icon">📱</span>オンライン参加
  </button>
</div>

<!-- PANEL: HOME -->
<div id="panel-home" class="vpanel active">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-info" style="animation: fadeUp 0.6s ease both;">
      <div class="infog">
        <div class="orbit-ring"></div>
        <div class="infog-center">
          <div class="infog-center-lbl">VOICES</div>
          <div class="infog-center-num" id="cntB">0</div>
          <div class="infog-center-sub">住民の声</div>
        </div>
        <div class="sat sat-ws" title="ワークショップ">
          <div class="sat-icon">🏘</div>
          <div class="sat-n">8</div>
          <div class="sat-lbl">ワーク<br>ショップ</div>
        </div>
        <div class="sat sat-online" title="オンライン参加">
          <div class="sat-icon">📱</div>
          <div class="sat-n">12</div>
          <div class="sat-lbl">オンライン<br>プロジェクト</div>
        </div>
        <div class="sat sat-data" title="データ分析">
          <div class="sat-icon">📊</div>
          <div class="sat-n">52%</div>
          <div class="sat-lbl">ポジティブ<br>意見</div>
        </div>
        <div class="sat sat-arch" title="アーカイブ">
          <div class="sat-icon">📁</div>
          <div class="sat-n">24</div>
          <div class="sat-lbl">公開<br>資料</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="animation: fadeUp 0.6s ease both; animation-delay: 0.1s;">
      <div class="hero-eyebrow">
        <span class="pulse"></span> 山口県柳井市  まちなか夢プラン
      </div>
      <h1 class="hero-title">
        まちの未来を、<br>
        <span class="em">みんなで共創</span><br>
        しよう。
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        対面ワークショップとオンライン参加の両方で、<br>
        誰もが参加できるまちづくりを実現します。<br>
        学生・シニア・子育て中も、あなたの声が届く。
      </p>
      <div class="dual-cta">
        <a href="#" onclick="showPanel('ws', document.querySelectorAll('.ttab')[1]); return false" class="cta-ws">
          <span class="cta-icon">🏘</span>
          <span class="cta-text"><span>ワークショップ</span><span class="cta-sub">対面で参加する</span></span>
        </a>
        <a href="#" onclick="showPanel('online', document.querySelectorAll('.ttab')[2]); return false" class="cta-online">
          <span class="cta-icon">📱</span>
